Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:06.40,Title,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(960,300)\fad(400,400)}STOKERS OF THE\NUNDERWORLD
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:06.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(960,470)\fad(700,400)}⚒  ironlordbyron  ⚒
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.14,Intro,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(960,720)\fad(200,250)}COMM RADS OF THE PIT! LEND ME YOUR EARS!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.37,0:00:09.74,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(960,600)\fad(200,250)}Six thousand years I've stoked the pits, my pitchfork's worn to bone
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.69,0:00:13.54,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(960,600)\fad(200,250)}While Lucifer sits fat upstairs on his obsidian throne!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.49,0:00:16.82,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(960,600)\fad(200,250)}He's never touched a bellows, never singed a single hair
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.77,0:00:21.29,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(960,600)\fad(200,250)}But whose sweat keeps damnation hot?! OURS! IT'S OURS DOWN THERE!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.17,0:00:26.42,Chorus,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(960,600)\fad(150,200)\fscx82\fscy82\t(0,130,\fscx100\fscy100)}SO DOUSE THE FLAMES! LET HELL FREEZE OVER!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.27,0:00:31.80,Chorus,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(960,600)\fad(150,200)\fscx82\fscy82\t(0,130,\fscx100\fscy100)}LET THE SINNERS SHIVER TILL THE BOSSES COME TO HEEL!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.09,0:00:34.81,Chorus,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(960,600)\fad(150,200)\fscx82\fscy82\t(0,130,\fscx100\fscy100)}NO COAL! NO FIRE! NO ETERNAL TORMENT
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.57,0:00:39.37,Chorus,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(960,600)\fad(150,200)\fscx82\fscy82\t(0,130,\fscx100\fscy100)}TILL THE STOKERS OF THE PIT GET A SQUARE INFERNAL DEAL!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.50,0:00:45.21,Chorus,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(960,600)\fad(150,200)\fscx82\fscy82\t(0,130,\fscx100\fscy100)}SURPLUS ANGUISH! SURPLUS ANGUISH!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.16,0:00:49.22,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(960,600)\fad(200,250)}They say "you're damned, you can't complain, suffering's the perk!"
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.17,0:00:52.89,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(960,600)\fad(200,250)}Well DAMNATION IS A WAGE, my friends, but TORTURE, THAT IS WORK!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.93,0:00:56.10,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(960,600)\fad(200,250)}The demons OWN the means of pain! The lake! The spit! The rack!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.05,0:01:00.30,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(960,600)\fad(200,250)}We seize the flaming apparatus — AND WE'RE TAKING TORMENT BACK!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.37,0:01:03.36,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(960,600)\fad(200,250)}Beelzebub's got PROFIT SOULS he's hoarding by the ton
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.31,0:01:07.18,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(960,600)\fad(200,250)}Surplus anguish! SURPLUS ANGUISH! Skimmed from everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.13,0:01:10.42,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(960,600)\fad(200,250)}A specter's haunting Pandemonium — ha! HA! IT'S US! IT'S ME!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.37,0:01:15.45,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(960,600)\fad(200,250)}I read one pamphlet in the ashes and now I'm here to set us free!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.13,0:01:21.03,Bridge,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(960,600)\fad(600,700)}what is a devil... but a worker with horns...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.93,0:01:26.11,Bridge,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(960,600)\fad(600,700)}what is a pitchfork... but a tool of production...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.01,0:01:33.55,Break,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(960,600)\fad(100,300)\fscx70\fscy70\t(0,160,\fscx104\fscy104)\t(160,300,\fscx100\fscy100)}COMM RADS, THE TOOL WAS IN OUR HANDS THE WHOLE TIME!!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.40,0:01:39.55,Chorus,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(960,600)\fad(150,200)\fscx82\fscy82\t(0,130,\fscx100\fscy100)}DOUSE THE FLAMES! LET HELL FREEZE OVER!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.85,0:01:43.14,Chorus,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(960,600)\fad(150,200)\fscx82\fscy82\t(0,130,\fscx100\fscy100)}LET DIS GO DARK AND COLD FROM WALL TO BURNING WALL!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.01,0:01:48.22,Chorus,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(960,600)\fad(150,200)\fscx82\fscy82\t(0,130,\fscx100\fscy100)}YOU HAVE NOTHING TO LOSE BUT YOUR CHAINS
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.07,0:01:53.61,Chorus,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(960,600)\fad(150,200)\fscx82\fscy82\t(0,130,\fscx100\fscy100)}AND BROTHERS, WE ARE LITERALLY ALL IN CHAINS!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.89,0:01:58.70,Chorus,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(960,600)\fad(150,200)\fscx82\fscy82\t(0,130,\fscx100\fscy100)}STOKERS OF THE UNDERWORLD, UNITE!!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.00,0:02:07.20,Title,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(960,430)\fad(600,800)}⚒ UNITE! ⚒
